# tools/public-export.sh: paths of the development repository (Gitea) that the public copy leaves out.
# One shell glob per line, relative to the repository's root; a directory takes everything in it.
# Session logs, hand-overs and plans written for the next session, drafts of mails, scratch scripts:
SESSION.md
SESSION-full.md
PROGRESS.md
HANDOFF-WAYLAND.md
FEATURES.md
PLAN.md
notes
# the open-stack backport's scratch scripts (its patch, compat header, includes and firmware are build inputs: kept)
powervr-backport/*.sh
powervr-backport/*.py
powervr-backport/HANDOFF-*.md
docs/NEXT-SESSION-PROMPT.md
# the development logs of the sessions since 2026-11-15 and the owner's hardware test notes (stories of the owner's
# home, network and days; the release carries a test record of its own)
docs/RADXA-SYNC-2026-11-15.md
docs/HARDWARE-CHECKLIST.md
docs/superpowers
# the run log of one builder's machine (src/registry.py writes a new one) and its local settings
registry.json
# (a7a-fedora.json: untracked since 2026-11-24, .gitignore keeps it out)
# the rules of a coding assistant used for this repository
.clinerules
# a patch kept beside the one in use, never applied
tools/patches/*.new
